1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,260
Aapka project ek zombie library

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:06,000
par chal raha hai…

3
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,220
aur Dependabot aapko

4
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,760
yeh kabhi nahi bataega.

5
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,160
npm install karte hi

6
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:13,400
yeh peele-peele deprecated warnings

7
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,380
dikhte hain?

8
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,860
Ya Python update karte hi

9
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:18,150
tests crash ho jaate hain?

10
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:20,060
Hum sab inhe ignore kar dete hain.

11
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,840
Lekin problem yeh hai —

12
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:24,240
jo library abandoned ho chuki hai,

13
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,560
uska kabhi naya version

14
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,700
aayega hi nahi.

15
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,740
Matlab koi security fix bhi nahi.

16
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:30,640
Scanner bolega “all up to date”…

17
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,180
aur aapka project

18
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:34,200
andar se khokhla hota rahega.

19
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,860
Welcome to Awesome Repos,

20
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,720
Day 3 — Graveyard Check,

21
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,320
by Taha Kotwal.

22
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:40,720
Bas ek command chalao —

23
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:41,900
graveyard-check scan

24
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,300
aur yeh aapki poori

25
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:44,880
dependency list check kar leta hai.

26
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:47,260
npm, pnpm, yarn…

27
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,520
aur Python bhi.

28
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:50,720
Har package ko ek verdict milta hai —

29
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:52,180
maintained, at-risk, ya

30
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,080
likely-abandoned

31
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,440
aur saath mein proof:

32
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,580
“No release in 4 years.”

33
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,700
Aur sabse kamaal ki baat?

34
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:59,520
Yeh sirf problem nahi batata —

35
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:01,040
replacement bhi batata hai.

36
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:02,260
request dead hai?

37
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:04,040
got ya axios use karo.

38
00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:05,060
pycrypto dead hai?

39
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:06,320
pycryptodome lagao.

40
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:07,680
GitHub Action laga do,

41
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:09,620
toh yeh har hafte khud check karega,

42
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,260
aur koi dead dependency mili

43
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,980
toh build wahin fail kar dega —

44
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,880
production tak pahunchne se pehle.

45
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:17,660
Na signup, na server, na tracking.

46
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:18,680
MIT licensed,

47
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:20,400
poori tarah open source.

48
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:22,280
Aur website pe bina install kiye bhi

49
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:23,260
try kar sakte ho.

50
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:24,360
Repo ka link chahiye?

51
00:01:24,380 --> 00:01:25,840
Comment mein likho “DEAD”

52
00:01:25,860 --> 00:01:27,840
link seedhe aapke DM mein aa jayega.

53
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:29,520
Aur GitHub pe Taha ko

54
00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:31,100
ek Star zaroor dena.

55
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:32,920
Aise open-source Indian developers ko

56
00:01:32,940 --> 00:01:34,300
support milna chahiye.

57
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:36,000
Aise hi aur awesome repos ke liye —

58
00:01:36,020 --> 00:01:37,020
Computer Hub ko

59
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:38,650
abhi Follow kar lo!
